      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1790599798900,
      "created": 1790599739997,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "A program is a passive executable \nstored on disk; when the OS loads\nand starts executing it, it becomes \na process. The OS maintains a PCB \nfor each process and manages its \nCPU state, memory, files, and \nother resources. ",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "A program is a passive executable \nstored on disk; when the OS loads\nand starts executing it, it becomes \na process. The OS maintains a PCB \nfor each process and manages its \nCPU state, memory, files, and \nother resources. ",
